OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe car park damage after
OL,4,Afootball match
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating allegations an
OL,7,Fangle grinder was used to cut open
OL,8,Fgates to free people whose vehicles had
OL,9,Fbeen locked in a car park while they
OL,10,Fwatched a children's football match.
OL,12,FStaff from Old Catton Parish Council,
OL,13,Fon the outskirts of Norwich, shut the
OL,14,Fcar park at 16:00 GMT on Tuesday
OL,15,Fdespite there being several vehicles
OL,16,Fstill parked there.
OL,18,FSome were owned by parents who had
OL,19,Fturned up to watch their children play
OL,20,Ffootball on the neighbouring junior
OL,21,Fschool's playing field.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
